  "excerpt": "[docs/resource-guides/aws/custom.md#other-aws-services-type-custom]\n`custom` is for any service that isn't a bucket, queue, topic, database or cache: DynamoDB, Secrets Manager, Kinesis, EventBridge, Bedrock, a third-party API. pskit only passes its details to your functions (`external: true` is required). pskit grants **no IAM permissions** for `custom` resources: add them under `provider.iam.statements`. Use `${tf:...}` only for resources you also define in `provider.terraform.extra`; for console-created ones, paste the ARN.",
